Philippines", "url": "https://ipfs.io/ipfs/bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq/wiki/Roman_Catholic_Diocese_of_San_Jose_in_Nueva_Ecija.html#1"}, {"date": null, "snippet": "[WEB_EXCERPT_REMOVED]", "summary": "[WEB_EXCERPT_REMOVED]", "title": "DBpedia 2015-10 | DBpedia", "url": "http://fragments.dbpedia.org/2015-10/en?object=%22The%20Roman%20Catholic%20Diocese%20of%20San%20Jose%20in%20the%20Philippines%20(Lat%3A%20Dioecesis%20Sancti%20Iosephi%20in%20Insulis%20Philippinis)%20is%20an%20ecclesiastical%20territory%20or%20diocese%20of%20the%20Latin%20Rite%20of%20the%20%20Roman%20Catholic%20Church%20in%20the%20Philippines.%20The%20diocese%20was%20founded%20in%201984%2C%20having%20previously%20formed%20part%20of%20the%20Diocese%20of%20Cabanatuan.%20It%20is%20a%20suffragan%20of%20the%20Archdiocese%20of%20Lingayen-Dagupan.The%20diocese%20held%20its%20first%20Diocesan%20Synod%20in%20March%202011%20led%20by%20the%20Apostolic%20Nuncio%20to%20the%20Philippines.%20And%20the%20diocese%20celebrated%20its%20Silver%20Anniversary%20of%20Canonical%20Erection%20last%20July%2014%2C%202009.%20%20On%20April%2020%2C%20Pope%20Benedict%20XVI%20named%20its%20third%20bishop%2C%20Most%20Rev.%20Mylo%20Hubert%20C.%20Vergara%2C%20as%20the%20bishop%20of%20Pasig.%20At%20present%2C%20the%20diocese%20is%20headed%20by%20its%20fourth%20bishop%20Most%20Rev.Roberto%20Calara%20Mallari%20D.D.%2C%20former%20Auxiliary%20Bishop%20of%20the%20Archdiocese%20of%20San%20Fernando%2C%20Pampanga%22%40en"}, {"date": "2023-09-15T16:00:00+00:00", "snippet": "[WEB_EXCERPT_REMOVED]", "summary": "[WEB_EXCERPT_REMOVED]", "title": "Roman Catholic Diocese of San Jose (Nueva Ecija) - Diocese of San Jose de Nueva Ecija", "url": "https://browse.library.kiwix.org/content/wikipedia_en_all_maxi/A/Roman_Catholic_Diocese_of_San_Jose_(Nueva_Ecija)#1"}], "status": "ok"}
